{"id":"vergu_enza","lemma":"vergüenza","pos":"noun","rank":1087,"glosses":["shame","embarrassment"],"ipa":"/beɾˈɡwenθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"vergüenzas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/37/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-verg%C3%BCenza.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me da vergüenza salir vestido así.","en":"I'm ashamed to go out dressed like this.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/635504","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},null,{"g":"to go out"},{"g":"dressed"},{"g":"like this"}]},{"text":"Siento mucha vergüenza.","en":"I feel so embarrassed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455203","words":[{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null]},{"text":"Tengo vergüenza de mí mismo.","en":"I'm ashamed of myself.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453132","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"same"}]},{"text":"No tengas vergüenza de ser pobre.","en":"Don't be ashamed of being poor.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587304","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"poor"}]},{"text":"A él le da vergüenza preguntar.","en":"He is ashamed to ask questions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/634929","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"he"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},null,{"g":"to ask"}]}]}